8.26 run#aFailedCheckDoesNotClearTheSummary — a run in which a finding failed clears no summary (issue #666) (tools/sensors/run.sh)
8.27 run#aSecondOverBoundRunListsWhatItDidNotFile — each over-bound run names the conditions it did not file (issue #666) (tools/sensors/run.sh)
